.TH CARGO-PGRX-0195 1 "2026-11-23" "PGSTY" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cargo-pgrx-0195 \- run cargo-pgrx 0.19.5 with the current PGSTY Rust toolchain
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cargo-pgrx-0195
.I subcommand
.RI [ arguments ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cargo-pgrx-0195
runs cargo-pgrx 0.19.5 with the current packaged Rust toolchain. Unless
PGRX_HOME is already set, configuration is isolated under
$HOME/.pgrx/0.19.5.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Requires rust-toolchain 1.96.0 or newer. Extension builds also require
PostgreSQL development headers and a C compiler.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B cargo-pgrx-0195 --version
Display the cargo-pgrx version.
.TP
.B cargo-pgrx-0195 init --pg17=/usr/pgsql-17/bin/pg_config --no-run
Initialize an RPM-style PostgreSQL 17 development configuration.
.TP
.B cargo-pgrx-0195 package --pg-config=/usr/lib/postgresql/17/bin/pg_config
Build a Debian-style PostgreSQL 17 extension package directory.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/pgsty/cargo-pgrx/0.19.5
Versioned cargo-pgrx program root.
.TP
.I $HOME/.pgrx/0.19.5
Default per-user configuration directory.
